OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fand thunderstorms will clear from
OL,7,Fcentral and eastern areas this
OL,8,Fevening. Rain will also develop over
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland, moving into southern
OL,10,FScotland during the early hours. Clear
OL,11,Fspells elsewhere overnight, with a
OL,12,Fscattering of showers. A mild night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA bright start, though rain
OL,15,Fwill move northeastwards across
OL,16,FScotland during the morning. For most
OL,17,Fit will be a day of sunshine and
OL,18,Fshowers, these heavy with hail and
OL,19,Fthunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
